# Composio assignment: sequential execution board

Status: Tasks 01–09 completed and accepted (AI review only; no human review). Task 09 (Research batch 3: Communications and Messaging, IDs 21–30) passed independent read-only AI review after claim-grounding remediation in `work/research-runs/task09-first-pass-004` (see `outputs/task-09-review.md` and `outputs/task-09/`: 54 captured sources, 192 eligible assertions, 417 verified evidence refs, `accuracy: null`). Task 10 and all later tasks remain queued; none has started.

The coordinator reviews each handoff before dispatching the next task. Each agent receives a bounded file scope, inputs, outputs and acceptance checks. The current checkpoint covers Task 09 approval; Task 10 (Marketing, Ads, Email and Social, IDs 31–40) is next.

## Rules

- Existing results are preliminary hypotheses, not completed research.
- Every task returns files, evidence, checks and unresolved issues.
- An unknown can be a valid research result; an inaccessible page is not proof that the product has no API.
- No fabricated human review, accuracy improvement or publication.
- Future owners below are queued role assignments, not claims that agents are already running.
- Respect user-requested review checkpoints: share the completed task's reviewed results before starting the next task.

